**C2 (126).** In `Oxpd1Soap.ReadAnswer` (BASE `Oxpd1Soap.cs:128`), the `TextOnly` condition (BASE `:174`) gains: any attribute of `first` (the response element) that is not a namespace declaration, OR any text node of `first` that is `XCData` or not `IsXmlWhiteSpace`. Its doc comment (BASE `:125` to `:127`) says so. Nothing else of `ReadAnswer` changes (rows without `TextOnly` read as before).
